#. 戦刃むくろを殺したのは
#. 誰でしょうかね？
msgctxt "0001 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So who did it...?\n"
"Who killed her?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>彼女を殺したのは
#. 黒幕<CLT>よ…
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Whoever did it is the same one\n"
"who's <CLT 9>behind everything<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. それだけは間違いないわ。
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That much I'm sure of."
msgstr ""

#. だけどよ、
#. そもそも黒幕って…
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "But when you think about it..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に、この学園の
#. 中にいんのか？
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Is the mastermind\n"
"really here in the school?"
msgstr ""

#. 当たり前じゃん！
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は<CLT 9>この学園に
#. いる<CLT>はずだって！
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "They hafta be <CLT 9>here somewhere<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. なぜ、そう思う？
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What makes you so sure?"
msgstr ""

#. えっと…
#. どうしてだっけ…？
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Umm...\n"
"what *does* make me so sure...?"
msgstr ""

#. 適当よ…だって黒幕が
#. ここにいる訳ないもの…
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Exactly. You're j-just making stuff up.\n"
"There's no way the m-mastermind is here."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕はきっと…
#. <CLT 9>別の場所にいる<CLT>はずよ…
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"The mastermind is\n"
"p-probably <CLT 9>a million miles away<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. だ、だって…奥に
#. 潜んでこその黒幕じゃない…！
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"C-Cuz masterminds always\n"
"lurk off in the b-background, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>どうして断言できるの…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>How can you be so sure?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>問題は黒幕が誰で…<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>The question is...who is the mastermind?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>どこにいるのかって事だ。<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>And where are they now?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>な、なんでだよ…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Wh-What...?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ほう…根拠はあるのか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Well now, do you have proof?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そ、そうかしら…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>I'm not sure...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>だとしたら…<CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>If that's really true...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>どうやって殺人を犯したの？<CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>How did they pull off the murder?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>俺もそんな気がするべ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's what I was wondering!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>それも適当だろう…<CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>I highly doubt that...<CLT>"
msgstr ""
